{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜……真是不速之客」", "text_idx": 123, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0620", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，久违了，兰华女士……\\n　不，濑名校长」", "text_idx": 126, "plain": "「呵呵呵，久违了，兰华女士……　不，濑名校长」", "plain_idx": 127, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0138", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一来就讽刺我吗？」", "text_idx": 129, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0621", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「您想多了」", "text_idx": 131, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0139", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……像以前那样叫我兰华就行了，\\n　我现在姑且还将你算作我的亲友」", "text_idx": 133, "plain": "「……像以前那样叫我兰华就行了，　我现在姑且还将你算作我的亲友」", "plain_idx": 134, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0622", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊呀，这样啊，\\n　我还以为我一直被你讨厌着呢……」", "text_idx": 136, "plain": "「啊呀，这样啊，　我还以为我一直被你讨厌着呢……」", "plain_idx": 137, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0140", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀～我倒是被你家姑娘讨厌着」", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0623", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽？不会吧……」", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0141", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你没听她说过吗？\\n　我给她带来了许多痛苦回忆……」", "text_idx": 143, "plain": "「你没听她说过吗？　我给她带来了许多痛苦回忆……」", "plain_idx": 144, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0624", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽在我面前一直都很坚强……」", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0142", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这点倒是和我家姑娘有几分相似」", "text_idx": 148, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0625", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小爱还好吗？」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0143", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她离开家了」", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0626", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀呀……」", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0144", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「孩子也长大了」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0627", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊……」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0145", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如何？最近过得怎么样？」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0628", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「托您所赐」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0146", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是么，别像以前那样逞强了。\\n　你也知道，我们不再年轻了」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": "「是么，别像以前那样逞强了。　你也知道，我们不再年轻了」", "plain_idx": 165, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0629", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起这个，你年轻时那莽撞的样子……」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0147", "char_id": "結子"}]}
