{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，现在回想还挺有意思的」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0148", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是呢」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0631", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0149", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，孩子终究是随父母的。\\n　美羽和你当年一模一样」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": "「不过，孩子终究是随父母的。　美羽和你当年一模一样」", "plain_idx": 178, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0632", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是么」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0150", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和你一样的坦率、耿直，还有……」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0633", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那让人心生嫉妒的澄澈目光」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0634", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不也是这样吗？」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0151", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别这样，我不是那种人」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0635", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我可忘不了和你一起为了保护森林四处奔走的时光」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": "「……我可忘不了和你一起为了保护森林四处奔走的时光」", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0152", "char_id": "結子"}]}
